# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Everything here is optional — the site builds
# and runs without any of it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Lifts the GitHub API rate limit on the "Open source" section from 60 req/hr
# (anonymous) to 5000. A fine-grained token with NO scopes is enough — it only
# reads public data.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_xxx

# Wire up the contact form. Without RESEND_API_KEY the form gracefully falls
# back to opening the visitor's mail client with the message pre-filled.
# Get a key at https://resend.com
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxx

# Must be a domain you've verified in Resend. Defaults to Resend's test sender.
# CONTACT_FROM=Portfolio <hello@yourdomain.com>

# Where form submissions land. Defaults to the email in src/lib/data.ts
# CONTACT_TO=vruship13@gmail.com
